## Usage

{% if tool == "flyway" %}
Apply forward migrations with Flyway (`sql/V*.sql`). Pair each version with
`sql/U{n}__*.sql` for rollback.
{% elif tool == "atlas" %}
Apply `migrations/*.sql` with Atlas. Each forward file needs a matching
`*.down.sql`.
{% else %}
Apply with Alembic (`alembic upgrade head`). Every revision must define
`downgrade`.
{% endif %}

Destructive DDL in **forward** files requires an entry in
`waivers/destructive.yaml` (`path`, `reason`, `expires_at`). See
[ADR 012](https://github.com/opsdevcode/repave/blob/main/docs/adr/012-destructive-ddl-policy.md).

